//! Sidecar-only generated syntax codec renderer API.
//!
//! This hidden module owns the small renderer and artifact-metadata surface used
//! by the syntax generated-code gate. It consumes checked `GrammarIR ->
//! StructuralModel` sidecars plus sidecar evidence fixtures, and deliberately
//! does not route through `TctCompiler` or the JSON Schema code generator.

